  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut sweet potato into fries. <br>• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2391cf8f6928425d5c30c/step-eb350c00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the fries are baking, pick and finely chop rosemary leaves.<br>• Thinly slice brown onion.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2391cf8f6928425d5c30c/step-b45d7110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place Parmesan cheese in even circles (about the same size as your buns, 1 per person) on a second lined oven tray. <br>• Bake until the cheese is golden and crisp at the edges, 6-8 minutes. <br>• Remove from the oven and set aside. The Parmesan crisps will harden as they cool. <br><br>TIP: Keep an eye on the crisps, they can burn quickly!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2391cf8f6928425d5c30c/step-1d32a220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the crisps are baking, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion and remaining rosemary, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes. <br>• Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2391cf8f6928425d5c30c/step-04916830.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. <br>• Meanwhile, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes. Thinly slice the tomato.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2391cf8f6928425d5c30c/step-9c307c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide the sweet potato fries between plates. <br>• Spread the bases with the Italian truffle mayonnaise and top with mixed salad leaves, sliced tomato, plant-based crumbed chicken, Parmesan crisps and rosemary caramelised onion to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e2391cf8f6928425d5c30c/step-2e38da50.jpg"
    }
  ]
